# INTO THE BURNING'S FOUNDRY QUIETLY (docs/interiors, 21_doors `room_dark` and
# `_screens`): the pour is the only light, and it is what shows you; the cooling
# racks stand to the ceiling between the line and the south wall, and behind
# them it is darker than any night and out of both turrets' lines. So down the
# hatch crouched, under the sweep of the turret over the furnace, along behind
# the racks, and into the store at the far end while the one over the quench
# looks away: at the box, nothing in the foundry has noticed the player.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/foundry-sneak.tour --seed=4 --hour=15 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is the foundry just come down into, crouched. 02 is at the store's box,
# having kept behind the racks and waited out the sweeps (`unnoticed`).
coast calm
near door:foundry
await door 5
hold crouch
press use 0.1
await inside:foundry 5
wait 0.3
shot 01-down-the-hatch-crouched with inside:foundry,mob:warden
walkto strongbox 60
wait 0.4
shot 02-at-the-store-unseen with inside:foundry,box_near,unnoticed
